        "id": "t4",
        "description": "Removing a todo updates the list",
        "hint": "Add two todos, delete one, verify the remaining todo remains",
        "input": "render(<TodoList />); fireEvent.change(input, { target: { value: 'Todo 1' } }); fireEvent.click(addButton); fireEvent.change(input, { target: { value: 'Todo 2' } }); fireEvent.click(addButton); fireEvent.click(deleteButtonForTodo1);",
        "expected_output": "Todo 2"
      }
    ]
